# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository AND in the working tree.
# Without `eol=lf`, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true writes CRLF into
# the working tree, which Prettier (endOfLine: "lf") then reports as an error on
# every single line — ~14k phantom lint errors. Git's stored blobs are already LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch these.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.pdf  binary
